        },
        {
          "text": "The PROV-JSONLD representation of this example can be seen in Example 1. At the top level, a",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            541.5,
            534.47,
            553.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "PROV-JSONLD document is a JSON object with two properties @context and @graph, as per JSON-",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            559.5,
            559.61,
            571.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LD. A context contains mappings of prefixes to namespaces, and also an explicit reference to",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            577.5,
            514.93,
            589.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "https://openprovenance.org/prov-jsonld/context.jsonld — the JSON-LD 1.1 context defining the",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            595.5,
            530.07,
            607.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "semantic mapping for PROV-JSONLD. (This context is fully described in section 5.) The @graph",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            613.5,
            539.66,
            625.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "property has an array of PROV expressions as value. Each PROV expression is itself a JSON object",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            631.5,
            548.82,
            643.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with at least a @type property (for instance, Entity, Agent or Derivation). Each of these PROV",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            649.5,
            523.18,
            661.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "expressions provides a description of a resource. Some of these resources have an identity provided by",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            667.5,
            561.56,
            679.5
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            12.0
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the @id property (for instance, ex:article1 or ex:derek). Other resources are anonymous and, therefore,",
          "bbox": [
            69.0,
            685.5,
